{"content_hash": "ecdb007e8e2539a1", "version_id": 1043, "article_id": 105, "level_code": "en_b1", "lang": "en", "level": 3, "level_label": "B1 中级", "title": "Meta owns 85% of AI glasses while China's market stays split", "title_zh": "Meta拿下全球85%的AI眼镜市场，中国却还在打混战", "has_translation": true, "topic": "business", "source": "tmtpost", "source_url": "https://www.tmtpost.com/8213674.html", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1689439518196-f48a24b49fb5?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8OHx8bWV0YXxlbnwwfDB8fHwxNzk1MzExMDg5fDA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Julio Lopez on Unsplash", "author": "Julio Lopez", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@juliolopez?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/a-person-holding-up-a-cell-phone-in-front-of-a-sign-ilbjfRwOgzA?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(186, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(224, 46%, 48%)", "label": "BUSINESS", "seed": "8382d9bae0e2"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-22", "word_count": 171, "reading_minutes": 0.9, "lead": "Meta sells most of the world's AI glasses, but no Chinese company has taken the lead at home. Big brands and small makers are all trying different ideas, and shoppers are still deciding what they want.", "lead_zh": "全球大部分AI眼镜都是Meta卖的，但在中国，还没有哪家公司真正领先。大厂和专业厂商都在试不同的路子，消费者也还在想清楚自己到底要什么。", "preview": "Meta shipped 3.4 million AI glasses in the first half of 2026 and held 81.3% of the global market. Its closest rival sold only about 100,000", "preview_zh": "2026年上半年，Meta出货340万副AI眼镜，占全球市场81.3%。它最大的对手只卖了约10万副。Meta能成功，是因为和EssilorLuxottica合作，用户可以在普通门店试戴、配镜片。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 1026, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/105/en_b1.mp3", "duration": 65.675, "size_bytes": 394992, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 190, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/105/en_b1_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 67.375, "size_bytes": 405216, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 190, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/105/en_b1_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/105/en_b1_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 71.95, "size_bytes": 432720, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 190, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/105/en_b1_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/105/en_b1_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 63.125, "size_bytes": 379728, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 190, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/105/en_b1_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/105/en_b1_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 67.225, "size_bytes": 404352, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 190, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/105/en_b1_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@c391479e/content/data/versions/1043.json", "paragraphs": ["Meta shipped 3.4 million AI glasses in the first half of 2026 and held 81.3% of the global market. Its closest rival sold only about 100,000 pairs. Meta succeeded because it worked with EssilorLuxottica, so users could try the glasses on and add lenses in ordinary stores.", "China looks very different. Alibaba, Yingmu and Xiaomi together hold less than half of the market, and each follows its own plan. Xiaomi builds simple glasses without a screen, while Rokid and RayNeo focus on displays that show text in front of your eyes.", "Growth at home is slowing down. China's smart glasses shipments fell 8% in the second quarter of 2026, although AR glasses with displays grew fast. Many users return the products because the glasses feel heavy or do not fit well.", "Meta can keep spending because its advertising business pays the bills. Chinese startups like XREAL lose money and must raise funds again and again. Experts say the winner will be the company that makes people wear their glasses every day."], "paragraphs_zh": ["2026年上半年，Meta出货340万副AI眼镜，占全球市场81.3%。它最大的对手只卖了约10万副。Meta能成功，是因为和EssilorLuxottica合作，用户可以在普通门店试戴、配镜片。", "中国的情况很不一样。阿里、影目和小米加起来还占不到一半市场，而且各走各的路。小米做的是不带屏幕的简单眼镜，Rokid和雷鸟则把重点放在能在眼前显示文字的屏幕上。", "国内的增速正在放缓。2026年第二季度，中国智能眼镜出货量下降8%，不过带显示的AR眼镜增长很快。很多用户会退货，因为眼镜太重或者戴着不合适。", "Meta能一直投钱，是因为广告业务在买单。XREAL这样的中国创业公司还在亏损，只能一轮轮融资。专家认为，最后的赢家会是那家能让用户每天都愿意戴上眼镜的公司。"], "body": "Meta shipped 3.4 million AI glasses in the first half of 2026 and held 81.3% of the global market. Its closest rival sold only about 100,000 pairs. Meta succeeded because it worked with EssilorLuxottica, so users could try the glasses on and add lenses in ordinary stores.\n\nChina looks very different. Alibaba, Yingmu and Xiaomi together hold less than half of the market, and each follows its own plan. Xiaomi builds simple glasses without a screen, while Rokid and RayNeo focus on displays that show text in front of your eyes.\n\nGrowth at home is slowing down. China's smart glasses shipments fell 8% in the second quarter of 2026, although AR glasses with displays grew fast. Many users return the products because the glasses feel heavy or do not fit well.\n\nMeta can keep spending because its advertising business pays the bills. Chinese startups like XREAL lose money and must raise funds again and again. Experts say the winner will be the company that makes people wear their glasses every day.", "body_zh": "2026年上半年，Meta出货340万副AI眼镜，占全球市场81.3%。它最大的对手只卖了约10万副。Meta能成功，是因为和EssilorLuxottica合作，用户可以在普通门店试戴、配镜片。\n\n中国的情况很不一样。阿里、影目和小米加起来还占不到一半市场，而且各走各的路。小米做的是不带屏幕的简单眼镜，Rokid和雷鸟则把重点放在能在眼前显示文字的屏幕上。\n\n国内的增速正在放缓。2026年第二季度，中国智能眼镜出货量下降8%，不过带显示的AR眼镜增长很快。很多用户会退货，因为眼镜太重或者戴着不合适。\n\nMeta能一直投钱，是因为广告业务在买单。XREAL这样的中国创业公司还在亏损，只能一轮轮融资。专家认为，最后的赢家会是那家能让用户每天都愿意戴上眼镜的公司。", "text": "Meta shipped 3.4 million AI glasses in the first half of 2026 and held 81.3% of the global market. Its closest rival sold only about 100,000 pairs. Meta succeeded because it worked with EssilorLuxottica, so users could try the glasses on and add lenses in ordinary stores. China looks very different. Alibaba, Yingmu and Xiaomi together hold less than half of the market, and each follows its own plan. Xiaomi builds simple glasses without a screen, while Rokid and RayNeo focus on displays that show text in front of your eyes. Growth at home is slowing down. China's smart glasses shipments fell 8% in the second quarter of 2026, although AR glasses with displays grew fast. Many users return the products because the glasses feel heavy or do not fit well. Meta can keep spending because its advertising business pays the bills. Chinese startups like XREAL lose money and must raise funds again and again. Experts say the winner will be the company that makes people wear their glasses every day.", "vocab": [{"word": "ship", "pos": "verb", "zh": "出货；发货", "note": "商业语境里指把产品卖到渠道", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "rival", "pos": "noun", "zh": "竞争对手", "note": "常与 closest 搭配", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "market share", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "市场份额", "note": "说占比时常用 hold / gain share", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "focus on", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "专注于", "note": "后接名词或动名词", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "shipment", "pos": "noun", "zh": "出货量", "note": "常用复数 shipments", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "slow down", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "放缓", "note": "可指增长、速度下降", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "return", "pos": "verb", "zh": "退货", "note": "名词 return rate 指退货率", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "raise funds", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "融资", "note": "创业公司常用表达", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "lose money", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "亏损", "note": "反义为 make money", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "winner", "pos": "noun", "zh": "赢家", "note": "竞争中领先的一方", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-22T01:31:27.743031", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "Meta", "s": 0.325, "e": 0.588, "sm": 325, "em": 587, "cs": 0, "ce": 4, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "shipped", "s": 0.588, "e": 0.887, "sm": 587, "em": 887, "cs": 5, "ce": 12, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "3.4", "s": 0.887, "e": 1.7, "sm": 887, "em": 1700, "cs": 13, "ce": 16, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "million", "s": 1.7, "e": 2.075, "sm": 1700, "em": 2075, "cs": 17, "ce": 24, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "AI", "s": 2.075, "e": 2.425, "sm": 2075, "em": 2424, "cs": 25, "ce": 27, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "glasses", "s": 2.425, "e": 2.95, "sm": 2425, "em": 2949, "cs": 28, "ce": 35, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "in", "s": 2.95, "e": 3.037, "sm": 2950, "em": 3037, "cs": 36, "ce": 38, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": "the", "s": 3.038, "e": 3.125, "sm": 3037, "em": 3124, "cs": 39, "ce": 42, "si": 0}, {"i": 8, "w": "first", "s": 3.125, "e": 3.375, "sm": 3125, "em": 3375, "cs": 43, "ce": 48, "si": 0}, {"i": 9, "w": "half", "s": 3.375, "e": 3.587, "sm": 3375, "em": 3587, "cs": 49, "ce": 53, "si": 0}, {"i": 10, "w": "of", "s": 3.587, "e": 3.675, "sm": 3587, "em": 3674, "cs": 54, "ce": 56, "si": 0}, {"i": 11, "w": "2026", "s": 3.675, "e": 4.862, "sm": 3675, "em": 4862, "cs": 57, "ce": 61, "si": 0}, {"i": 12, "w": "and", "s": 4.862, "e": 5.0, "sm": 4862, "em": 5000, "cs": 62, "ce": 65, "si": 0}, {"i": 13, "w": "held", "s": 5.0, "e": 5.225, "sm": 5000, "em": 5224, "cs": 66, "ce": 70, "si": 0}, {"i": 14, "w": "81.3", "s": 5.225, "e": 6.295, "sm": 5225, "em": 6295, "cs": 71, "ce": 75, "si": 0}, {"i": 15, "w": "%", "s": 6.295, "e": 6.562, "sm": 6295, "em": 6562, "cs": 75, "ce": 76, "si": 0}, {"i": 16, "w": "of", "s": 6.562, "e": 6.638, "sm": 6562, "em": 6637, "cs": 77, "ce": 79, "si": 0}, {"i": 17, "w": "the", "s": 6.638, "e"